		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1521EF011A60705F"]
			description: ["The &6Von Neumann Foundry&r builds a probe that builds a copy of itself, from feedstock and parts made on the spot. Once a seed is here, the cluster feeds its own growth. An OpV hull, the robust casing and assembly line grating, with feedstock from the refinery. The self-copying probe and the mega-family of the age. Every input comes from the cluster by belt, so build it last and wire it to the rest."]
			icon: "gtceu:von_neumann_foundry"
			id: "10ABDF6F9EF0EBC0"
